# Oracle. Deliberately excluded from the image: `make test` stages the current
# test.sh/smoke.py into the running container with `docker cp`, so editing the oracle
# never invalidates the Maven build layer. `scarf validate` copies smoke.py into the
# candidate's output/ before running `make test`, which is exactly this path.
test.sh
smoke.py
smoke/
